      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst file = items[0];\nconst fileName = file.json.name || 'document.pdf';\n\n// Get binary data using n8n's helper\nconst binaryKeys = Object.keys(file.binary || {});\nconst binaryPropertyName = binaryKeys[0];\n\n// Use this.helpers to get proper base64\nconst binaryDataBuffer = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, binaryPropertyName);\nconst base64Content = binaryDataBuffer.toString('base64');\n\nconst htmlBody = '<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.8;\">' +\n  '<p><strong>Yth.<br>Bapak/Ibu IT Support SD6</strong></p>' +\n  '<p>Sehubungan dengan telah selesainya dilakukan testing pada project terkait. Dengan ini kami mengajukan testing lanjutan kepada tim IT Support SD6 beserta dengan file yang terlampir.</p>' +\n  '<div style=\"background: #f0f8ff; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; margin: 20px 0;\">' +\n  '<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><strong>File Terlampir:</strong> ' + fileName + '</p>' +\n  '</div>' +\n  '<p>Demikian informasi yang dapat saya sampaikan dan terima kasih atas perhatian dan kerja samanya.</p>' +\n  '<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><strong>Regards,</strong><br><br>' +\n  '<strong style=\"color: #0066cc;\">Ridho Wisnu</strong><br>' +\n  '<em style=\"color: #666;\">IT Software Development 6</em></p>' +\n  '</div>';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    sender: {\n      email: \"firmanwisnu432@gmail.com\",\n      name: \"Ridho Wisnu\"\n    },\n    to: [{\n      email: \"ridhowisnufirmantya@gmail.com\",\n      name: \"Ridho Wisnu Firmantya\"\n    }],\n    subject: \"Pengajuan Testing Lanjutan - IT Support SD6\",\n    htmlContent: htmlBody,\n    attachment: [{\n      name: fileName,\n      content: base64Content\n    }]\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
